                    سوقك، بائعينك، في مكان واحد — <em>"Where Vendors Meet Customers"</em>. Connect directly with specialized stores, enjoy unified multi-vendor checkout, and track your orders in real-time.
                </p>

                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <a href="#products" class="btn-nexa-primary">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-bag-shopping"></i>
                        <span>Start Shopping</span>
                    </a>
                    <a href="#become-vendor" class="btn-nexa-outline">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-store"></i>
                        <span>Open Your Store</span>
                    </a>
                </div>

                <!-- Live Marketplace Stats -->
